After suite S47, appending into a layout session throws when the incoming rows need a dimension to grow:
- a dimension the config declares whose columns arrive for the first time;
- a new column in an existing dimension;
- a metadata constant that starts varying and belongs to a dimension (`PlanAppend`, `DuckDbStore.Layout.cs` "Adding dimension …", "Adding column … to dimension …", "only spine columns are supported …").

`databall/docs/ROADMAP.md` S6 and suite `AGENTS.md` listed this under db-01. The owner split it out on 2026-09-29 to keep db-01 at size M.
